00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.630
<i>The designated emergency evacuation location for this area</i>

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:42.430
<i>is Kamogawa Girls' High School!</i>

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:45.390
<i>Keep moving and make your way over there quickly!</i>

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.310
There's broken glass inside the building.

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:51.020
Stay away from windows!

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.740
Get inside quickly!

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:03.620
Ms. Machiko...

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:04.870
Don't worry.

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.490
Everything's going to be okay.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.880
Still no signs of Aura, Lympha or Ignis!

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:18.170
We have no line with any of the pilots!

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.340
I don't care, keep trying to contact them!

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:22.130
Don't overlook even the weakest signal!

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:25.680
Pharos to Aura, Lympha, Ignis. Do you read?

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.350
Respond, Madoka!

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.140
Lan! Muginami! Can you hear me?!

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.390
More regions are reporting abnormal phenomena!

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:30.640
Please respond!

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:34.520
Asia! Oceania! Europe! And now we're getting reports

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:37.610
from Africa and North, Central, and South America, as well!

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.610
This thing really is trying to swallow the entire Earth.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:44.490
Just like it did 20,000 years ago...

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:52.460
What's going to happen?

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.840
Many ancient ruins foretell the end of the world.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.920
Predictions of the world being consumed by fire,

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:03.260
or the coming of an evil devil that preys on humans.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:04.890
You mean?

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:08.220
At any rate, we'll have our answer soon.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.560
This looks like the place where I met Yurikano before.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.650
But it's different.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:22.030
It wasn't icy and cold like this.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.280
It didn't feel this intense either.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.910
I wonder if Lan and Muginami are here too?

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.580
Where could they be?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.880
Madoka! Where are you?

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:38.250
Muginami! Can you hear me?

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.170
I can't even contact Pharos.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.220
Where am I?

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:44.340
Madoka?

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:51.680
Hey!

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:52.850
Can anyone hear me?!

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:54.940
Lan!

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:56.310
Muginami!

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.530
Oh, so you <i>were</i> here...

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.570
Lan's brother!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:21.920
Hey! Why'd you do such a terrible thing to Big Brother Giuvi?

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.090
No, not just him.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.630
You betrayed all of us.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.430
Everyone who believed in you that day...

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.800
Lan, Muginami, the people of the Polyhedron...

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:30.970
Yurikano...

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:32.600
And me, too!

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.140
Say something!

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:48.450
Midori!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.450
I'm really mad now!

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:03.630
Tell me...

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:07.930
Why did things turn out like this?

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:13.930
Where did we go wrong?

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:18.480
Stop that...

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:20.690
Let me sleep.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.870
You made a vow to us!

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:39.870
You agreed to join hands with Big Brother Giuvi once more!

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:44.290
We were all happy when you said that, so why?

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.220
Even if you are my brother...

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:56.430
No, it's <i>because</i> you're my brother.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:00.480
I must stop you... As your sister!

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:10.700
Anyone who hurts Lan, or makes Madoka suffer...

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.700
will answer to me!

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:18.080
I won't forgive you.

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:21.670
I'll never, ever, ever... forgive you!

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:35.430
That "success" I gave you...

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.680
I take it back now!

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:43.400
Captain! On the antenna tower!

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:48.940
It's almost here...

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.530
I can feel it...

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:52.650
the tingling...

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:28.480
Why?

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:30.110
Why can't I beat him?!

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:41.290
bI don't deserve a success... if I can't beat him!

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.400
W-What?!

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:22.950
Damn it! It's going to engulf us too!

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:23.830
<i>Move it!</i>

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.330
Array!

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.590
Come on!

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:43.520
Is this the consequence of what you believed in?

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:52.860
Good.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:54.360
It's nice and tainted.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.450
We're almost there.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.240
Say...

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.490
Tell me something.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.080
Who are you?

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.750
On that day 20,000 years ago,

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:09.420
I watched you, just like I am doing right now.

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:12.710
Queen Maycun.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:33.110
I watched you go through everything.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:37.240
The history you shared with the Vox...

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:41.990
<i>Queen Maycun did just as we had planned.</i>

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:47.160
<i>Yes. Now, all we need is for her to open the Rin-ne.</i>

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:51.750
How your most trusted and closest people betrayed you,

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.750
using you like a puppet...

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:59.170
Tormenting you to the deepest and farthest depths of your inner mind.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:00.760
<i>Why?</i>

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:03.970
<i>Why?!</i>

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:26.990
I witnessed everything, Queen Maycun.

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:29.290
Good.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.710
Then you can answer my questions

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:35.040
without holding anything back.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:38.880
What did you do to Dizelmine?

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.590
Nothing.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:46.100
Although you could say that I helped him

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.430
realize his true feelings.

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:51.390
True feelings?

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:58.400
He finally realized the hatred he felt towards Villagiulio.

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.280
So you made him open the Rin-ne.

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:08.240
And?

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:11.830
What is it that you seek?

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:20.420
This whole world is about to be swallowed into nothingness again.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:23.220
What will this madness bring you?!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:25.050
Do you not wish to hear it?

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.050
To hear "its" voice?

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:33.140
The Rin-ne is a place where people's hearts connect.

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:36.020
The Vox acts as an interface between those two worlds,

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.610
like a bridge guard.

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:41.190
It grants passage to those it has deemed worthy

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:43.360
by bestowing them the Memoria.

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:48.370
I then realized, the stronger the bond

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:52.040
between those who've achieved Memoria and their Vox,

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:56.750
the more that person's will is converted into the power of the Rin-ne.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.050
And that's when I felt it...

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:02.260
The will of a greater presence!

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:08.930
In the past, in an attempt to hear that voice,

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:11.640
I tried giving myself to the Vox.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:16.100
But my soul was not deemed worthy of the Memoria.

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:21.730
No matter how many times I tried, no matter what I did!

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:25.900
I drowned in despair.

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:29.620
That's when you appeared before me.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.030
And yet!

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:40.130
You think you have the right to condemn me?!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.050
You make me laugh!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.920
Everything goes back to that day, when you didn't fulfill my desire...

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.760
You're the one who's at fault here!

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:52.640
You used Madoka just for that?!

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:58.900
I failed, Midori.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.570
I couldn't win.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.360
I had to beat him at all cost.

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:09.990
If I didn't, it would mean that Lan's brother was right.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.170
<i>I hate this...</i>

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.310
My phone works in here?

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.890
Email? Who is it from?

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:41.270
Get your act together, Madoka!

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:33.320
<i>I believe this is our destiny.</i>

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.450
<i>Destiny?</i>

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:34.990
<i>That's right.</i>

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.790
<i>I can't do this by myself.</i>

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.750
<i>You can't do this by yourself, either.</i>

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:43.210
<i>But if we join hands and work together,</i>

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:49.710
<i>we can overcome any problems the Polyhedron might face in the future...</i>

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.590
<i>We're comrades.</i>

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:03.140
<i>Yeah, we're in this together, through good and bad times.</i>

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:18.620
So that's what happened.

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.540
Geez, why didn't you just say so?

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:21.200
Huh?

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:24.170
What's that, Midori? Look up?

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:28.840
Ouch! That hurt...

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:31.260
What was that for?!

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.100
Okay, then!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:03.580
We want to talk.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:09.750
Madoka, Muginami. I'm sorry...

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:14.470
My beloved brother has turned into a demon.

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:18.760
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:23.560
Madoka, Lan...

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:27.980
I know I always depend on you guys too much.

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:31.150
So I thought I should at least try and avenge my Big Brother on my own, but...

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:32.150
Ouch!

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.990
<i>That hurt!</i>

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:35.200
Muginami!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:37.160
<i>Oww!</i>

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:38.110
Lan?

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:39.990
Madoka?

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:44.870
What do you know!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.540
<i>You're here!</i>

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.750
I didn't care who it was.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:55.340
As long as it was someone who would give in to their emotions, and unleash it completely.

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:58.510
Anyone with the potential,

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:01.350
to allow me to hear that voice from the Rin-ne.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:05.430
I suppose I should thank you.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:09.230
I now know what needs to be done.

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:12.270
There's nothing more you can do.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:15.030
No, there is one thing.

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.860
Believe in Madoka.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.290
I see...

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.920
You and Muginami decided what to do after high school.

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.010
We're sorry.

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:38.130
Don't apologize.

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:41.140
It's only natural to want to return to your home planets.

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.930
No, about not telling you until today...

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:49.770
Yeah, if the two of you had left Kamogawa without saying anything,

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:53.400
I probably would've been angry.

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:04.990
